TypeScript 7.0.2 after a clean 6.0.3 build. `"types": ["node"]` on the server tsconfig and the eight AI-provider project configs. `scripts/package_upgrade.sh` installs Express 5.3 and TypeScript 7.0.2, then test, lint, and `build:all`. Version `0.90.5`. No QA follow-ups.
